{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "model": "reviewed-capability-plus-growth-reserve",
  "principles": [
    "ADR 0139 / G01 admits exactly GuiIconPosition on Engine ./gui, GuiTabHeaderOptions on existing ./gui-layout and 12 ./gui-controls symbols for G10. Original GuiContent, GUI identity, layout, theme, modal/input and resource owners are reused. Root symbols, old reserves and all performance/resource budgets remain unchanged.",
    "ADR 0139 / G01 admits exactly 2 Tilemap atlas/transform types for G08 (8→10), preserving existing reserves. Same original component/system identities; existing production palette/textured 2D programs and frame/tracker owners are reused. No other symbols or performance/resource budget change.",
    "ADR 0139 / G01 admits exactly 9 focused gui-collections symbols for G07; only the numeric window is shared with HYA, original GUI/input owners remain. No root, performance or resource budget growth.",
    "ADR 0139 / G01 admits exactly seven InputActionMap symbols on Engine ./input and six input-actions symbols on extensions for G06, zero new-entry reserve. Existing class identities, root symbols and existing reserves/budgets remain unchanged.",
    "ADR 0139 / G01 admits exactly four focused camera2d exports for G05, with zero symbol reserve. Existing entries, performance/resource budgets and capability reserves stay unchanged.",
    "ADR 0139 / G01 admits 3 physics, 2 backend and 4 character2d exports for G04. Existing Engine reviewed counts increase only by the 3/2 frozen symbols; reserve sizes remain 5/6 and all other entry budgets stay unchanged.",
    "ADR 0139 / G01 admits exactly 6 focused scene-flow symbols for 0.2.3, zero reserve; G03 serial integration adds only that frozen entry. No root, performance or resource budget change.",
    "G13 proposal admits the exact ADR 0134 HYA format/runtime symbol lists (55 plus 37) with zero growth reserve; review/engine-0.2.2/g11-public-api-admission.md. Existing reserves and all performance/package limits are unchanged.",
    "ADR 0117 admits one ColorCMYK export in ./color for the next minor release; root and all growth reserves remain unchanged.",
    "G06 admits 5 Deferred lighting facade symbols in experimental/renderer and the compatibility aggregate; review/engine-0.2.1/g06-example-api-review.md. No stable root or performance budget growth.",
    "ADR 0100 adds optional native GUI/font raster callbacks with zero exported-symbol growth; existing root and domain budgets are unchanged.",
    "The Engine root is an exact golden path, not a capacity pool.",
    "New capabilities use focused entrypoints and are classified stable or experimental before baseline promotion.",
    "Reviewed symbol counts describe admitted capability scope; reserve absorbs implementation-shaped API growth but never bypasses API baseline review.",
    "A capability addition must update its reviewed count, evidence, package measurement, and baseline in one reviewed change.",
    "ADR 0108 adds 11 focused GPU instance/simulation symbols and 9 compatibility aggregate exports for 0.2.1; evidence: review/engine-0.2.1-gpu-instances.md.",
    "ADR 0106 admits audio mixing, multiplayer input, fonts, animation interaction and virtual joystick for 0.2.0; evidence: review/release-0.2.0-capability-budgets.md."
  ],
